n.com/en_us/prescriptive-guidance/latest/cloud-design-patterns/hexagonal-architecture.html" /><meta name="keywords" content="AWS prescriptive guidance,Modernization,ContainersAndMicroservices,Serverless,Migration,ApiGateway,DynamoDB,Lambda,StepFunctions" /><link rel="alternate" type="text/markdown" href="hexagonal-architecture.md" title="Markdown version" /><script type="application/ld+json">
